# Generated by render_*.py on every run (~45 s to rebuild, ~100 MB incl. 1,000+
# intermediate PNG frames). The committed inputs are the renderers and the scene
# JSONs; the rendered mp4/png output is build artefact, never source.
diagrams/

# Untrusted third-party downloads pulled at run time (e.g. the world-atlas
# countries-110m.json that render_diagrams_yingxian.py's `map` scene needs —
# github.com is proxy-blocked in routine sessions, so it comes from a CDN).
# Keep downloads out of git; see automation/youtube/state/research.md 2026-11-13
# if we ever decide to vendor that file instead.
dl/
